  m_text: "It's almost time for your EXAM! better hurry and RUSH to school.\n\n(Level
    1) \nBefore going to school collect items so you can leave the house.\n\nItems
    to Collect:\n- Exam Permit\n- Uniform\n- Baon (money)\n- Ballpen\n- Backpack\n\n(Level
    2)\nYou have reach STI Bacoor School be sure you are prepared for the exam.\n\nItems
    to Collect:\n- Bubble Sheet\n- Reviewer\n- Exam Paper\n\nObjectives:\n- Collect
    Items to complete the level. (2 items Passing)\n- Repeat levels and make your
    personal best and FASTEST score.\n"
